# LOG_050: Research → Deployment → Adoption

**Date:** 2026-08-06
**Source:** Field Observation - Technology Lifecycle
**Tags:** #Adoption #Innovation #Systems #VaultPrinciple

## Observation
Technology only becomes important when people use it. Sequence: Years of research → Working technology → Real users → Ecosystem growth.

## Pattern
Most teams stop at Deployment. They ship and assume adoption follows. It doesn’t.

## Vault Principle
**Innovation is only half the journey. Adoption completes it.**

## Leverage
Measure success by users and usage, not features shipped or papers published.

